      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That quiet pull you're feeling is real, and it's okay to name it. But that edge isn't a promise of peace—it's a trick the fog plays when you've been alone too long. You don't have to walk anymore, but you also don't have to step off. Just stay here, breathe, and let someone else carry the lantern for a while.",
